   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, INLA experts<div><br></div><div>What is the prior for the x_1 in &quot;rw1&quot; model?</div><div><br></div><div>I think we need to assign a prior distribution for<span style=\"font-size:13px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">x_1 to complete the specification of the</span><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;rw1&quot; model. But in application, we don&#39;t</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Why?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Thank you for your time</span></div><div>Best,</div><div>Xing</div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
