   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n<div>The model is specified here </div>\r\n<div><br></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\"><a href=\"http://www.math.ntnu.no/inla/r-inla.org/doc/latent/rw1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.math.ntnu.no/inla/r-inla.org/doc/latent/rw1.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792446636087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19UvhwYpwKQzuNK2iOKR-h\">http://www.math.ntnu.no/inla/r-inla.org/doc/latent/rw1.pdf</a></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\">The prior is specified on the increments rather than the process itself, which leads to an intrinsic prior. </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\">Hope this helps</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\"><br></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;.HelveticaNeueUI&#39;;font-size:15px;line-height:19px;white-space:normal\">Dan</span></div>\r\n<div>—<br>Sent from <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/mailbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/mailbox&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792446636088000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2G6vxIeNpQHxo3eLJ1DcR4\">Mailbox</a> for iPhone</div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><p>On Thu, Oct 24, 2013 at 7:11 AM, Zhao Xing <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zhaox...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Sorry, forget about the second one<div>Just the 1st one</div>\r\n<div>I have some pressure to my research, so maybe ask some naive question. sorry</div></div></blockquote></div>"
